WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I knew he wouldn't agree

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,500
If it had been anyone else, Bajie might have come up long ago.

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,500
He and Wang Limei didn't.

4
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,010
I knew it

5
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:11,010
This guy misses my sister

6
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:13,010
Little sister, let’s go back

7
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:15,010
Our car is also in good repair

8
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:19,790
Here we go

9
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:21,390
Do you want to help me carry my luggage?

10
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:24,060
I used a gun as a fundraiser

11
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,860
Where do you move your things?

12
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:32,500
Just move it to the bus, right? It's broken.

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,850
He means it

14
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:47,420
That's right

15
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:53,160
What should I move?

16
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:57,170
Are you moving the daily necessities on the truck?

17
00:00:57,170 --> 00:00:58,170
relatively light
